Door="This is the main group the the door object"
PlayerInteactionArea="Group for the player interaction area."
PlayerInteractionShape="Group for the player interaction shape."
PlayerCollisionShape="Group for the player collision shape."
DoorInteractionArea="Group for the door interaction area "
DoorInteractionShape="Group for the door interaction shape"
DoorExitPositionMarker="Group for the door exit position marker 2d."

